Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?comms:=20silent=20auto-update=20=E2=80=94=20Pac?=
 =?UTF-8?q?kageInstaller=20installer=20+=20About=20toggle/grant?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Replaces the ACTION_VIEW + FileProvider install hand-off (which ALWAYS shows
the system installer dialog) with a PackageInstaller session (CommsInstaller):
when the Auto-update toggle is ON (default) and 'install unknown apps' is
granted, the session commits USER_ACTION_NOT_REQUIRED and the update installs
with no user tap. Without the grant Android emits STATUS_PENDING_USER_ACTION
which CommsInstallReceiver turns back into the normal prompt; toggle OFF forces
the prompt on purpose.

- CommsUpdateWorker.doWork(): background path now notifies AND (when ON)
  downloads + installs silently, instead of notify-only.
- FragmentOptionsCommsAbout: manual 'Check for updates' installs via the same
  path; adds an Auto-update toggle button + 'Install unknown apps' grant button
  (ACTION_MANAGE_UNKNOWN_APP_SOURCES) with live granted/denied labels.
- Manifest: registers CommsInstallReceiver (exported=false).
- Mirrors the Kotlin constellation apps (AutoUpdatePrefs + UpdateInstaller).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
